(7452211, 1179797, 97225, '<td valign="top">I processed this after a trip to the optometrist involving eye-drops, which made my eyes blurry and over sensitive to light. I think my processing is a bit off because of this. I tried to swap this out at the last minute for a totally different shot, but rollover beat me.</td>', 'I processed this after a trip to the optometrist involving eye-drops, which made my eyes blurry and over sensitive to light. I think my processing is a bit off because of this. I tried to swap this out at the last minute for a totally different shot, but rollover beat me.', '2016-04-27 02:11:03.000000', NULL, 0),
