(7452249, 1179759, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic composition, beautifully processed,  but I agree with Ammie you would hardly call this junk this is treasure that you would never throw away. I didn''t vote on this challenge anyway.</td>', 'This is a fantastic composition, beautifully processed,  but I agree with Ammie you would hardly call this junk this is treasure that you would never throw away. I didn''t vote on this challenge anyway.', '2016-04-27 09:29:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7452251, 1179769, 114285, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful light Ammie. I thought this was going to do well, so surprised it didn''t ribbon.</td>', 'Such a beautiful light Ammie. I thought this was going to do well, so surprised it didn''t ribbon.', '2016-04-27 09:30:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7452261, 1179641, 150277, '<td valign="top">I liked this image.  For me I''m not sure the shot screamed ''junk'', but this, imho, is so subjective.  I thought the image was well shot, although I might have liked it with a clean white background even more.  But it was crisp and I liked the colors.  The arrangement/presentation you chose initially made me think of a person (not sure why).  Anyway, I was surprised this finished where it did, I suppose maybe it was the interpretation of ''junk'', and the presentation of ''junk'' in such a clean image, that differed from what folks wanted to see.</td>', 'I liked this image.  For me I''m not sure the shot screamed ''junk'', but this, imho, is so subjective.  I thought the image was well shot, although I might have liked it with a clean white background even more.  But it was crisp and I liked the colors.  The arrangement/presentation you chose initially made me think of a person (not sure why).  Anyway, I was surprised this finished where it did, I suppose maybe it was the interpretation of ''junk'', and the presentation of ''junk'' in such a clean image, that differed from what folks wanted to see.', '2016-04-27 10:13:24.000000', NULL, 0),
